      ],
      "note": "Sources other.txt and new.txt arrive by the public source control and EX-live is registered by the engine (_register_execution) and ended by execution transitions; the legacy test injected source rows and an execution row. The source events queue a plan to reconsider them, so the legacy \"no research_plan while work runs\" is asserted as the exact whole queue: the snapshot before the refresh with only the new source's source_imported event joined to that plan, and the assessment still current; after the work ends the one plan names TK-1."
