      "note": "The missing input arrives by the public source control. Synthetic state kept from the legacy test: TK-1 is closed in place while holding a current incomplete assessment that waits for a missing input. The product does not make that state: a withdrawal moves the assessment to the task history (asserted by unit.test_planning_task_completion.PartialWithdrawalTests.test_assessed_partial_work_closes_without_becoming_complete) and closing by assessment records a terminal decision. Reaching the terminal branch of _refresh_readiness publicly needs a terminally assessed task whose cited evidence later changes, a different scene."
